				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "At one point we created a WhoAmI class to represent the user, their project etc, as a single method object for handling those parameters into a search path.\n{{gtExample:TTVault class>>traceCurrentSearchPath}}\n\nTo cut a long story short, just pass the whole vault, it is more than representative of the user and their context {{gtPragma:ttWhoAmI}}. There can be several vaults if dealing with multiple users or contexts. Copies of vaults are relatively efficient."
			}
